[] a owl:AllDifferent ;
    owl:distinctMembers ( lol:Category_Assassin lol:Category_Fighter lol:Category_Mage lol:Category_Marksman lol:Category_Support lol:Category_Tank ) .

[] a owl:AllDifferent ;
    owl:distinctMembers ( lol:Damage lol:Shield lol:Root lol:Slow lol:Stun lol:Heal lol:MovementSpeedBoost lol:Reveal lol:CooldownReduction lol:Empower lol:ControlImmunity ) .

